  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……っ、タイミングが悪いな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（智代子は──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "大丈夫ですよ、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……えへへ\r\n気を遣っていただいちゃいましたね……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──いやっ\r\nそういうつもりじゃ、なかったんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……すまん\r\n俺の方が気にしてたな",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ええっ、謝らないでください！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……知ってもらえていなかったのは悔しいんです\r\n私じゃなくて、他の子が見たかったって言われたのも",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……でも\r\nそれが私の実力で──それは全部、私のせいですから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だったら、これはもう頑張るしかない！\r\nって思うんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "060",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だから、『大丈夫』！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……強いな、智代子",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あはは……とはいえ、私が自力でどうにかできるのは\r\n自分の気持ちぐらいなんですけどね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "具体的にどうやって、お客さんたちを\r\n振り向かせたらいいのかは──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんと相談させてもらえたらなぁって\r\n思ってますよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000301/1010003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああ、もちろんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "絶対に力になれるように努力する\r\n──……いや、努力だけじゃ足りないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『智代子が万全の状態でオーディションに臨める』\r\nっていう状況を、約束する",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……勝ち残ろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003010170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
